DECISION
BOOK NOW

Only “WHY THIS DECISION?” contains meaningful explanation.

==================================================
CARGO DECISION LOGIC
==================================================

Do NOT create a fake AI score.

Use transparent prototype logic.

HARD CONSTRAINTS:

Vessel DWT >= Cargo Quantity
Draft <= Port Maximum Draft
LOA <= Port Maximum LOA
Beam <= Port Maximum Beam
Vessel availability fits laycan
Cargo compatibility

If any hard constraint fails:

Vessel must be marked unsuitable.

Effective Cost:

Effective Cost =
Freight
+ Bunker
+ Waiting
+ Other Applicable Costs

Risk categories:

Market Risk
Port Risk
Vessel Risk
Operational Risk

Decision logic should consider:

- Current freight
- Forecast direction
- Vessel feasibility
- Port feasibility
- Effective cost
- Risk
- Charter strategy

Return:

BOOK NOW
WAIT
MONITOR
REJECT

